<http://digistrucmed.org/entity-mention/lu_0074e29f31a1f0feb082e0064bee46f60bf6b5ae3f8703d1231341374ed97e52_n0012/e_0056> <http://digistrucmed.org/spanConfidence> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal> .
