<http://digistrucmed.org/normative-assertion/lu_0074e29f31a1f0feb082e0064bee46f60bf6b5ae3f8703d1231341374ed97e52_n0012/na_0009> <http://digistrucmed.org/deonticForce> "ADVISORY" .
